# Allow-list for the relay image, built from the repository root: everything is left out unless a line below lets it in.
# relay/state, relay/secrets, .git and .planning never enter the build context. Phase 71 adds !src/agent and what it imports.
*
!relay/package.json
!relay/package-lock.json
!relay/.npmrc
!relay/tsconfig.json
!relay/scripts
!relay/src
